
  index.html               shell
  src/app.js               composition root — wires tasks + notifications, owns nothing

  src/tasks/model.js       task shape, create/update/complete/delete, validation
  src/tasks/store.js       localStorage load/save, schema version
  src/tasks/ui.js          list + form rendering

  src/notifications/index.js       public interface: start(), stop(), onRemindersChanged()
  src/notifications/reminders.js   pure dueReminders(tasks, now, dismissed) -> Reminder[]
  src/notifications/dismissals.js  dismissed-key set, persistence, pruning
  src/notifications/scheduler.js   tick loop over an injected clock
  src/notifications/inpage.js      renders the reminder region
  src/notifications/os-notify.js   Notification API adapter (permission + fire)

